# every text file is LF in the working tree on every machine: the build embeds source files byte for byte and the simulator hashes them, so CRLF checkouts broke parity and provenance (2026-10-01)
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.mp3 binary
